        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>controlId</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>DCSIN_* constant. Determines <ref refid="namespacePanelBridge" kindref="compound">PanelBridge</ref> routing. </para>
