<para>The single polarity interpretation — used by both <ref refid="classOpenSkyhawk_1_1ActionButton_1aabb37477e23d2afe35ce097ac477ce16" kindref="member">poll()</ref> and <ref refid="classOpenSkyhawk_1_1ActionButton_1ab3d9d2f8aeea6361a02570bc69997dd2" kindref="member">forceReport()</ref>. </para>
        </briefdescription>
